c0060
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:27.000
And if you know the things, really if you know it, immediately you could tell where it comes from.

c0061
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:30.000
So, the sources are there.

c0062
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.000
But what is more important is the following.

c0063
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:39.000
That the Rabbi himself, when he writes Ramban, he does not write the sources.

c0064
00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:45.000
Not only he didn't write the sources, it was not customary for the Rabbis to point out the sources.

c0065
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.000
Why?

c0066
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:51.000
Because either you are a Rabbi, then immediately you know where the sources are.

c0067
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.000
Or you should know where the sources are.

c0068
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:57.000
Or you are not a Rabbi, in which case the sources were not there.

c0069
00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:10.000
But the second point why Ramban was attacked, is because Ramban said that God has no shape, no form, no size.

c0070
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:21.000
God's size is not a body, and if you believe that God has a body, then that is not Jewish belief.

c0071
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:31.000
In France at the time, and in Ashkenaz, Germany, the coming Jews believed that God had a body.

c0072
00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:44.000
And for them to see that their belief was heresy, that molested them, that bothered them very much.

c0073
00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:54.000
Now, because of this, a whole attack on Ramban and the mission of Tora began in France.

c0074
